{"data": [{"author_id": "4506749394", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:20:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114935277810819373"], "id": "2114935277810819373", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 290, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Voice AI is going to be huge. It’s way faster than typing, the defacto mode of working from last few decades. \n\nThinking could be even bigger than voice AI. What if you could just think and it leads to stuff? Brain-computer interface sounds like magic but in longer run, it’s", "url": "https://x.com/hellosimar/status/2114935277810819373"}, {"author_id": "809335045085270016", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:32:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114892840723726514"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/FRE5fthrqi", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/fuckanigashiut/status/2114892840723726514/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114892757303214080", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/FRE5fthrqi"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/FRE5fthrqi", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/fuckanigashiut/status/2114892840723726514/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114892767155679233", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/FRE5fthrqi"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/FRE5fthrqi", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/fuckanigashiut/status/2114892840723726514/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114892785795137536", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/FRE5fthrqi"}]}, "id": "2114892840723726514", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "HIS JUST DROPPED AND THE NARRATIVE IS INSANE.\n\nNeuralink restored movement to Bertha, a partially paralyzed sheep that had lost control of her back-left leg after suffering spinal damage.\n\nThey used a brain-computer interface to read the movement signals Bertha’s brain still https://t.co/FRE5fthrqi", "url": "https://x.com/fuckanigashiut/status/2114892840723726514"}, {"author_id": "705960937715572736", "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:00:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114945316491518115"], "id": "2114945316491518115", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 120, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "I was told that I had no self preservation if I didn't support Donald Trump. Donald Trump did not deliver on his promises. \n\nI am being told I have no self preservation if I don't support Elon Musk.\n\nElon Musk has his own private space agency, a literal tunnel boring company, and", "url": "https://x.com/veilreportlive/status/2114945316491518115"}, {"author_id": "375713091", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:45:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114896295353532441"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/JRAWR25muS", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Brekfres/status/2114896295353532441/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114896287061446657", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/JRAWR25muS"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/JRAWR25muS", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Brekfres/status/2114896295353532441/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114896291314470912", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/JRAWR25muS"}]}, "id": "2114896295353532441", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "THIS JUST DROPPED AND THE NARRATIVE IS INSANE.\n\nNeuralink restored movement to Bertha, a partially paralyzed sheep that had lost control of her back-left leg after suffering spinal damage.\n\nThey used a brain-computer interface to read the movement signals Bertha’s brain still https://t.co/JRAWR25muS", "url": "https://x.com/Brekfres/status/2114896295353532441"}, {"author_id": "1016170257084321792", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:19:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114824432414065060", "2114829176046018655"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 9, "id": "44196397", "start": 0, "username": "elonmusk"}]}, "id": "2114829176046018655", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk Acquiring Nvidia? = Yes, (and I can provide a reasonable method, and there is empirical evidence to prove the feasibility of this method, and it can be done immediately, and it is legal = a normal stock market transaction.)\n\nIn the financial investment field, the Mega 7", "url": "https://x.com/DavidPa71557488/status/2114829176046018655"}, {"author_id": "1016170257084321792", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:00:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114824432414065060", "2114829176046018655"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 9, "id": "44196397", "start": 0, "username": "elonmusk"}]}, "id": "2114824432414065060", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk Acquiring Nvidia? = Yes.\n\nIn the financial investment field, the Mega 7 (often written as Mag 7 or M7) refers to the seven largest technology giants in the US stock market, with enormous market capitalization and decisive influence on the overall market. These seven", "url": "https://x.com/DavidPa71557488/status/2114824432414065060"}, {"author_id": "2060104250596978688", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:04:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114825457568973193"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 78, "id": "44196397", "start": 69, "username": "elonmusk"}, {"end": 87, "id": "1818311005698678784", "start": 79, "username": "XFreeze"}]}, "id": "2114825457568973193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 141, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "很多人把脑机接口当成猎奇噱头\n \nNeuralink着眼帮助残障人士重获机能\n \n用科技修复身体的残缺\n \n医疗向脑机技术值得加速推进吗？@Elonmusk @Xfreeze", "url": "https://x.com/bestyou666/status/2114825457568973193"}, {"author_id": "1857405220143403009", "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:25:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114921421927526649"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/dVL5mtPxlz", "end": 44, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/liuyf651019/status/2114921421927526649/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114921410548371456", "start": 21, "url": "https://t.co/dVL5mtPxlz"}]}, "id": "2114921421927526649", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1925年，英国人就开始研究脑机接口啦！ https://t.co/dVL5mtPxlz", "url": "https://x.com/liuyf651019/status/2114921421927526649"}, {"author_id": "2029085675770003458", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:38:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114849195471364331"], "id": "2114849195471364331", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 273, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "少用小白鼠、先在\"迷你器官\"上试药的技术，北京这次点名要了。做实验耗材、做设备、做检测外包的老板，这张名单可能是今年最该盯的一张。\n\n北京第 22 批\"三新\"认定（新技术、新产品、新服务）开始申报，医药健康方向把类器官技术写进了征集领域，和脑机接口、细胞与基因治疗排在一起。今年 1", "url": "https://x.com/SoloFanstaph/status/2114849195471364331"}, {"author_id": "1305905708018348032", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:02:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114824950368629037"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/dDc2u53SB8", "end": 152, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CausMoney/status/2114824950368629037/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114824945284898816", "start": 129, "url": "https://t.co/dDc2u53SB8"}]}, "id": "2114824950368629037", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 935, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "美国拟扩大对华生物医药投资限制，药物海外授权交易暂未直接受限\n\n10月26日，《南华早报》报道，美国政府计划扩大对中国生物技术领域的投资限制，可能增加中国医药企业吸引美国资本、成立合资企业以及开展跨境合作的难度。不过，传统药物授权交易目前并未受到直接限制。 https://t.co/dDc2u53SB8", "url": "https://x.com/CausMoney/status/2114824950368629037"}, {"author_id": "1609897027709861888", "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:48:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114927077476757849"], "id": "2114927077476757849", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1287, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "A股机器人落地投资2027年最全图谱\n\n一、三重催化齐发：GTC柏林、政策以旧换新、资金共振\n\n本届GTC柏林核心信号有三：一是AI工厂产品化，Vera Rubin配合DSX", "url": "https://x.com/SYU77996/status/2114927077476757849"}, {"author_id": "1851491706", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114824391854788888"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 196, "start": 190, "tag": "jcesc"}, {"end": 214, "start": 197, "tag": "backgroundchecks"}, {"end": 219, "start": 215, "tag": "FBI"}, {"end": 224, "start": 220, "tag": "BCI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5XP0kdBe8L", "end": 248, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JCESC_VLA/status/2114824391854788888/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2105274033398824960", "start": 225, "url": "https://t.co/5XP0kdBe8L"}]}, "id": "2114824391854788888", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📋 BCI/FBI Background Checks at JCESC\n\nAppointments are available:\nTuesday–Thursday, 8:00 AM–3:00 PM.\n\nBCI: $40 credit / $35 cash\nFBI: $50 credit / $45 cash\n\n📞 Call 740-283-3347 to schedule\n\n#jcesc #backgroundchecks #FBI #BCI https://t.co/5XP0kdBe8L", "url": "https://x.com/JCESC_VLA/status/2114824391854788888"}, {"author_id": "2114857391950811136", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:47:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114866430944694471"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 19, "start": 15, "tag": "BCI"}], "urls": [{"description": "“La nueva estructura societaria busca potenciar el crecimiento del grupo\", explicó BCI.", "display_url": "latercera.com/pulso/noticia/…", "end": 132, "expanded_url": "https://www.latercera.com/pulso/noticia/accionistas-de-bci-group-aprueban-aumento-de-capital-para-avanzar-en-el-proceso-de-evolucion-societaria/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114866434300067840/DihDo-lH?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114866434300067840/DihDo-lH?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 109, "status": 200, "title": "Accionistas de BCI Group aprueban aumento de capital para avanzar en el proceso de evolución societaria - La Tercera", "unwound_url": "https://www.latercera.com/pulso/noticia/accionistas-de-bci-group-aprueban-aumento-de-capital-para-avanzar-en-el-proceso-de-evolucion-societaria/", "url": "https://t.co/zGJtidbb74"}]}, "id": "2114866430944694471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Accionistas de $BCI Group 🇨🇱 aprueban aumento de capital para avanzar en el proceso de evolución societaria\n\nhttps://t.co/zGJtidbb74", "url": "https://x.com/SERGI0R0SENBERG/status/2114866430944694471"}, {"author_id": "24590960", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:55:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114838278205472871"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "thebluecollarinvestor.com/achieving-our-…", "end": 189, "expanded_url": "https://www.thebluecollarinvestor.com/achieving-our-goal-when-selling-a-defensive-covered-call", "start": 166, "status": 200, "unwound_url": "https://www.thebluecollarinvestor.com/achieving-our-goal-when-selling-a-defensive-covered-call/", "url": "https://t.co/F9iAw9k21S"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/C0ATJkTaeY", "end": 213, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/thebcinvestor/status/2114838278205472871/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114838275223326721", "start": 190, "url": "https://t.co/C0ATJkTaeY"}]}, "id": "2114838278205472871", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "BCI In The Rearview... \nCheck out my article published to the BCI blog one year ago on 10/25/25 entitled \"Achieving Our Goal When Selling a Defensive Covered Call.\"  https://t.co/F9iAw9k21S https://t.co/C0ATJkTaeY", "url": "https://x.com/thebcinvestor/status/2114838278205472871"}, {"author_id": "97700380", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:26:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114861371351580751"], "id": "2114861371351580751", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 73, "impression_count": 11943, "like_count": 207, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "NON-INVASIVE BCI WORKS. I’VE MADE CONTACT WITH THOUGHT TO COMPUTER CAPABILITIES AND IT IS ABSOLUTELY STUNNING", "url": "https://x.com/andrewarruda/status/2114861371351580751"}, {"author_id": "14758716", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:39:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114864596137775447"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 257, "start": 245, "tag": "TheEdgeOfUs"}, {"end": 262, "start": 258, "tag": "BCI"}, {"end": 280, "start": 263, "tag": "HumanSingularity"}], "urls": [{"description": "Are We Prepared to Fight for Our Humanity in the Age of Brain-Computer Interfaces?", "display_url": "theedgeofus.com/p/un-warns-ai-…", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://www.theedgeofus.com/p/un-warns-ai-could-read-peoples-minds", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114864596846563328/zt1MTVM-?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114864596846563328/zt1MTVM-?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 220, "status": 200, "title": "U.N. Warns AI Could Read People’s Minds and Incriminate Oneself", "unwound_url": "https://www.theedgeofus.com/p/un-warns-ai-could-read-peoples-minds", "url": "https://t.co/phNwsfXhPS"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/uq3tCM2ZbX", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/chrissynewton/status/2114864596137775447/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114864592903872512", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/uq3tCM2ZbX"}]}, "id": "2114864596137775447", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 545, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "The human and technological singularities are converging. As brain-computer interfaces advance, will we use technology to empower humanity or risk losing our freedom of thought?\n\nRead my latest piece on The Edge of Us.\n\nhttps://t.co/phNwsfXhPS\n\n#TheEdgeOfUs #BCI #HumanSingularity https://t.co/uq3tCM2ZbX", "url": "https://x.com/chrissynewton/status/2114864596137775447"}, {"author_id": "1794498130659942401", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:13:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114827890546397695"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 268, "start": 262, "tag": "PiEEG"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/pZNkqhYaUF", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pieeg_official/status/2114827890546397695/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114827830991171584", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/pZNkqhYaUF"}]}, "id": "2114827890546397695", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 150, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "What if 64 Octopus-16 modules could work as ONE wearable BCI system? 🐙🧠\n\n64 modules × 16 channels = Up to 1,024 biosignal channels in a modular, honeycomb design.\n\nHelmet (EEG) 🧠 Bracelet (EMG) 💪 Flexible array ⚡\nScalable, open hardware. Should we build this? 👇\n#PiEEG https://t.co/pZNkqhYaUF", "url": "https://x.com/pieeg_official/status/2114827890546397695"}, {"author_id": "2102763945622937600", "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:59:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114914926166974823"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 36, "id": "1736719138410917888", "start": 24, "username": "alokrajRSSB"}]}, "id": "2114914926166974823", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Increase tha BCI post 🙏\n@alokrajRSSB", "url": "https://x.com/vishalgargir/status/2114914926166974823"}, {"author_id": "1863510095914512384", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:56:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114853637583175890"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 253, "start": 249, "tag": "BCI"}, {"end": 268, "start": 254, "tag": "BuildInPublic"}]}, "id": "2114853637583175890", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A weak decoder taught us humility today: our guarded speller went from 0% to 75% words right — not by guessing louder, but by refusing to auto-accept a weak guess. Top-2, retry, or fail in the open. Saturn teaches patience; the lab teaches honesty. #BCI #BuildInPublic", "url": "https://x.com/abstergo_media/status/2114853637583175890"}, {"author_id": "1884860185795231744", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:53:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114943403687583872", "2114943646755860532"], "id": "2114943646755860532", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 252, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Decade for biotech \nWould love to chat to anyone working with \n\n- 3d printed organs \n- diagnostics \n- BCI \n- genomics \n- sleep and mood disorders \n- psychedelics \n- optical and sound medtech", "url": "https://x.com/BenjaminDoversn/status/2114943646755860532"}, {"author_id": "1929209713331437568", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:41:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114865012594627064"], "id": "2114865012594627064", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "もしかしたらまた目、喉、頭、瞼、指、脚、腰、首、精巣挙筋などに広島大学病院の遠隔BCI医療テロ、デジタルツインテロから電磁波照射され攻撃されるかも。\n国際テロリストは医療に隠れて違法生成したデジタルツインで人々の脳思考を盗むAIを違法開発している。そこから裏金が国際テロリストにいく。", "url": "https://x.com/slO93X1rlC53348/status/2114865012594627064"}, {"author_id": "1884860185795231744", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:51:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114943012690362479"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/0HtQcuRIp8", "end": 73, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BenjaminDoversn/status/2114943012690362479/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114943001667739650", "start": 50, "url": "https://t.co/0HtQcuRIp8"}]}, "id": "2114943012690362479", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 72, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Can’t wait to airdrop books into my brain via BCI https://t.co/0HtQcuRIp8", "url": "https://x.com/BenjaminDoversn/status/2114943012690362479"}, {"author_id": "1794498130659942401", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:21:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114859878409752996"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 271, "start": 267, "tag": "BCI"}, {"end": 276, "start": 272, "tag": "DIY"}], "urls": [{"description": "High-quality, research-grade BCI hardware. Easy setup. For researchers and engineers.", "display_url": "pieeg.com", "end": 201, "expanded_url": "https://pieeg.com", "images": [{"height": 909, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114859891567243264/mhlHyY6Y?format=png&name=orig", "width": 1731}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114859891567243264/mhlHyY6Y?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 178, "status": 200, "title": "PiEEG — Low-Cost Brain-Computer Interface Hardware for Research", "unwound_url": "https://www.pieeg.com/", "url": "https://t.co/LMFpSvOTsS"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/AUfC47CT83", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pieeg_official/status/2114859878409752996/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114859865919139840", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/AUfC47CT83"}]}, "id": "2114859878409752996", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 163, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🐙 Free 16-channel EEG/EMG boards for home makers.\n\nBuild something in ~1 week with Octopus 16:\n🏠 Home control\n🗣️ Silent speech\n🎮 Gaming\n\nShare the result and we'll feature it on https://t.co/LMFpSvOTsS.\n\nApply by Oct 30: pieeg@pieeg.com\nSubject: \"Octopus Challenge\"\n\n#BCI #DIY https://t.co/AUfC47CT83", "url": "https://x.com/pieeg_official/status/2114859878409752996"}, {"author_id": "1675680785716658177", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:58:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114824030360318249"], "id": "2114824030360318249", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 436, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Un fondo de secundarios de BCI (II-B) perdió 16,6% de su patrimonio en el primer semestre de 2026: −3.497 ÷ 21.098 (miles de US$, estados financieros a junio). Se financió con US$76,9 millones prestados por Penta Vida y Vida Security al 8,7%.\n\nEn 2025, PE Secondary Deal II le", "url": "https://x.com/IgnacioMercados/status/2114824030360318249"}, {"author_id": "2069761290764181504", "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:56:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114914154368872932"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 12, "id": "1736719138410917888", "start": 0, "username": "alokrajRSSB"}]}, "id": "2114914154368872932", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@alokrajRSSB Major साहब, अब जब आपने कहा ही दिया है कि BCI SCI का रिजल्ट दिवाली से पहले दे देंगे तो दिनांक भी बता ही दो।", "url": "https://x.com/Sunil_9694/status/2114914154368872932"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "4506749394", "name": "Simar Singh", "username": "hellosimar"}, {"id": "809335045085270016", "name": "chosen", "username": "fuckanigashiut"}, {"id": "705960937715572736", "name": "The Veil Report", "username": "veilreportlive"}, {"id": "375713091", "name": "Brek", "username": "Brekfres"}, {"id": "1016170257084321792", "name": "VR3Dsound🎧", "username": "DavidPa71557488"}, {"id": "2060104250596978688", "name": "千帆过", "username": "bestyou666"}, {"id": "1857405220143403009", "name": "刘云枫", "usernam